{"id":"43a4fed5e784e206","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-min-function.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Minimum","display":"df-min-function — Primitive Recursive Minimum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-min-function","aliases":["57-df-min-function"],"display":"df-min-function — Primitive Recursive Minimum","depends_on":["[[57-df-subtraction-function]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-min-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-min-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-min-function — Primitive Recursive Minimum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7944760e23c02c51\" href=\"?note=7944760e23c02c51\" title=\"57-df-subtraction-function\">57-df-subtraction-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为集合论元语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y,z,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7944760e23c02c51\" href=\"?note=7944760e23c02c51\" title=\"57-df-subtraction-function\">57-df-subtraction-function</a> 的二元截断减法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\min_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是下式引入的二元全函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是集合取最小值的部分函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min(x,y)\">\\(\\min(x,y)\\)</span>、多参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> 和集合写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min A\">\\(\\min A\\)</span> 的接口在下式给出。点值只在各自定义域内使用；这些记号不向对象算术语言增加原始符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\qquad\n\\min(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\qquad\n\\min(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(x\\le y\\land z=x)\\lor(y&lt;x\\land z=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(x\\le y\\land z=x)\\lor(y&lt;x\\land z=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j&lt;n\\longrightarrow j\\notin A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j&lt;n\\longrightarrow j\\notin A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\min\\{x,y\\}=\\min(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\min\\{x,y\\}=\\min(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\min\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\min\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地补充定义。截断减法是原始递归全函数，两次复合给出二元 min 的原始递归性。按 x≤y 与 y&lt;x 分情形应用截断减法性质，得到所列取值刻画；固定参数个数的多参数 min 由有限次复合得到。自然数良序性保证每个非空 A 有唯一最小元，故集合图恰在所列定义域有值；空集不取默认值。</p>\n<p>二元公式核对依据：<a href=\"https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/kk3n/recursionclass/chap2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CMU《Primitive Recursion》§2.6.12</a>，印刷第 14 页／PDF 第 7 页。集合图与多参数记号是本地接口补充，不据此声称核验本书原文。对任意 A 的集合取值并不构成 A 的可判定性或统一可计算性结论；无界 μ 搜索仍使用本书已有最小化原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-subtraction-function","status":"resolved","id":"7944760e23c02c51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-subtraction-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-subtraction-function","status":"resolved","id":"7944760e23c02c51","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[57-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[57-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,z,j,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\min(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\min","display":false},{"tex":"\\min A","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\qquad\n\\min(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\min(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(x\\le y\\land z=x)\\lor(y<x\\land z=y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j<n\\longrightarrow j\\notin A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\min A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\min\\{x,y\\}=\\min(x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\min\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2699,"backlinks":[{"id":"be21afa871789456","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数集合的 $\\min$ 取 [[57-df-min-function]]，只在 $Z_{\\mathfrak A}\\ne\\varnothing$ 的分支调用。"},{"id":"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数集合的 $\\min$ 取 [[57-df-min-function]]；它与本条的无界 $\\mu$ 零点搜索按下式联系。"},{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数集合的 $\\min$ 取 [[57-df-min-function]]；下式的定义域前件保证停机历史见证集非空。"},{"id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数集合的 $\\min$ 取 [[57-df-min-function]]；纸带的有限支撑保证下述两个候选集均非空。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-min-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-d